      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think you should need this.  Instead below, I think you want \n\n```\nsdk_version: \"module_current\",\n```\n\nwhich will match everything in packages/modules/Bluetooth/framework/Android.bp.\n\nThat said, using flags from inside modules isn\u0027t supported yet, for a bunch of other reasons.  I think doing this here will be okay as long as nothing gets released, but that\u0027s dangerous.  @opg for comment.",
